  description="How Edwin Hubble proved the Universe is expanding: measuring galaxy distances with pulsating Cepheid stars and galaxy speeds from the redshift of their light, finding the simple proportional law between them, reading off the age of the Universe, and showing that space itself is expanding — the long echo of the Big Bang."
